{"id":"b387299f5e4dd383","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-suspension.md","title":"Suspension","display":"df-suspension — Suspension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-suspension","aliases":["58-df-suspension","Suspension"],"display":"df-suspension — Suspension","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-suspension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-suspension</span><span>Suspension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-suspension — Suspension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdeb0db348e01893\" href=\"?note=fdeb0db348e01893\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\Sigma X,\\tau_\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\Sigma X,\\tau_\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (product-topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (quotient-topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdeb0db348e01893\" href=\"?note=fdeb0db348e01893\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I\">\\(\\tau_I\\)</span> is its standard topology</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Suspension}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{Suspension}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (topological suspension predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suspension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Suspension}_S(\\Sigma X,\\tau_\\Sigma,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists R,q,\\tau_{X\\times I},\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X,I\\})\n\\land\\vec X(0)=X\\land\\vec X(1)=I\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau,\\tau_I\\})\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau_I\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land R=\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,t\\rangle,\\langle x&#39;,t&#39;\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\in(X\\times I)^2:\n(t=t&#39;=0)\\lor(t=t&#39;=1)\\lor(x=x&#39;\\land t=t&#39;)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Sigma X=\\{[z]_R:z\\in X\\times I\\}\n\\land q=\\{\\langle z,[z]_R\\rangle:z\\in X\\times I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_\\Sigma,q,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suspension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Suspension}_S(\\Sigma X,\\tau_\\Sigma,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists R,q,\\tau_{X\\times I},\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X,I\\})\n\\land\\vec X(0)=X\\land\\vec X(1)=I\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau,\\tau_I\\})\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau_I\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land R=\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,t\\rangle,\\langle x&#39;,t&#39;\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\in(X\\times I)^2:\n(t=t&#39;=0)\\lor(t=t&#39;=1)\\lor(x=x&#39;\\land t=t&#39;)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Sigma X=\\{[z]_R:z\\in X\\times I\\}\n\\land q=\\{\\langle z,[z]_R\\rangle:z\\in X\\times I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_\\Sigma,q,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Suspension: glue the two ends of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times I\">\\(X\\times I\\)</span> separately, then give the quotient the topology induced by the quotient map.</li>\n<li>Connectivity and reduced-homology suspension formulas are downstream theorems.</li>\n<li>Reduced suspension: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> smashed with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1\">\\(S^1\\)</span>; used in loop space adjunction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma \\dashv \\Omega\">\\(\\Sigma \\dashv \\Omega\\)</span></li>\n<li>Freudenthal: suspension isomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma: \\pi_n(X) \\to \\pi_{n+1}(\\Sigma X)\">\\(\\Sigma: \\pi_n(X) \\to \\pi_{n+1}(\\Sigma X)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\geq 1\">\\(n \\geq 1\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hopf fibration: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3 \\to S^2\">\\(S^3 \\to S^2\\)</span> with fiber <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1\">\\(S^1\\)</span>; relates suspensions</li>\n<li>Applications: stable homotopy theory, cohomology operations</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Whitehead, Elements of Homotopy Theory</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","exc