{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\Sigma X,\\tau_\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"I=[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Suspension}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suspension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Suspension}_S(\\Sigma X,\\tau_\\Sigma,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists R,q,\\tau_{X\\times I},\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X,I\\})\n\\land\\vec X(0)=X\\land\\vec X(1)=I\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau,\\tau_I\\})\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau_I\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land R=\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,t\\rangle,\\langle x',t'\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\in(X\\times I)^2:\n(t=t'=0)\\lor(t=t'=1)\\lor(x=x'\\land t=t')\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\Sigma X=\\{[z]_R:z\\in X\\times I\\}\n\\land q=\\{\\langle z,[z]_R\\rangle:z\\in X\\times I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_\\Sigma,q,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"S^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma \\dashv \\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma: \\pi_n(X) \\to \\pi_{n+1}(\\Sigma X)","display":false},{"tex":"n \\geq 1","display":false},{"tex":"S^3 \\to S^2","display":false},{"tex":"S^1","display":false}],"bytes":2707,"backlinks":[{"id":"6723a6e09cfa1b3f","anchor":"